{
"#useparam"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"使用 x qywx 发送、监听企业微信消息。"
,
"en"
:
"Send and listen to WXwork messages using x qywx."
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"zh"
:
"群机器人（x qywx bot）\n可用于向群聊发送单向通知，例如，CI/CD 构建通知（GitHub Actions），服务器监控告警\n获取方式: https://x-cmd.com/mod/qywx/cookbook-1\n"
,
"en"
:
"Webhook Bot (x qywx bot)\nUse case: One-way notifications to groups, e.g., CI/CD build notifications (GitHub Actions), server monitoring alerts\nSetup: https://x-cmd.com/mod/qywx/cookbook-1\n"
}
,
{
"zh"
:
"智能机器人（x qywx abot）\n用于发送和接收消息，通过 WebSocket 启动后台监听消息服务\n首次使用需要配置 bot_id 和 bot_secret（从企业微信开放平台创建应用获取）\n配置命令：x qywx --cfg bot_id=<id> bot_secret=<secret>\n"
,
"en"
:
"Intelligent Bot (x qywx abot)\nUse case: Send and receive messages via WebSocket background listener service\nFirst-time setup requires bot_id and bot_secret (from WXwork Open Platform application creation)\nConfiguration command: x qywx --cfg bot_id=<id> bot_secret=<secret>\n"
}
,
{
"zh"
:
"接入 x claw 作为私人 AI 助手：\n1. 配置 bot_id 和 bot_secret\n2. 启动企业微信后台监听消息服务：x qywx abot service start\n3. 启动 x claw 接入企业微信: x claw start --qywx\n"
,
"en"
:
"Integrate with claw as private AI assistant:\n1. Configure bot_id and bot_secret\n2. Start WXwork background listener service: x qywx abot service start\n3. Start x claw to integrate with WXwork: x claw start --qywx\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x qywx init"
,
"zh"
:
"交互模式初始化配置"
,
"en"
:
"Initialize configuration in interactive mode"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x qywx send --text \"x-cmd 新版本发布成功\""
,
"zh"
:
"发送文本消息到企业微信群"
,
"en"
:
"Send text messages to WXwork group"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x qywx abot send --text --chatid <chat_id> \"Hello\""
,
"zh"
:
"使用智能机器人发送文本消息"
,
"en"
:
"Send text messages using intelligent bot"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x qywx abot service start"
,
"zh"
:
"启动智能机器人监听服务"
,
"en"
:
"Start intelligent bot listener service"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x qywx abot service stop"
,
"zh"
:
"停止监听服务"
,
"en"
:
"Stop listener service"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x qywx react --runner repl"
,
"zh"
:
"启动交互式指令模式，将收到的消息作为命令执行并返回结果"
,
"en"
:
"Start interactive REPL mode, executing messages as commands and returning output"
}
]
,
"#subcmd:config"
:
[
"init"
,
"--cfg"
,
"--cur"
]
,
